Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.06,0:00:00.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,Why is this
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.62,0:00:01.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,guardrail covered in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.66,0:00:02.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,spinning yellow rollers?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.14,0:00:03.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,It's a rolling
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.88,0:00:04.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,barrier made in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.69,0:00:05.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,South Korea for
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.64,0:00:06.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,dangerous curves.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.95,0:00:07.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,Hit a plain
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.55,0:00:08.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,steel rail and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.32,0:00:09.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,it scrapes and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.02,0:00:09.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,drags at
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.61,0:00:10.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.36,0:00:11.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,These rollers are
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.25,0:00:12.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,barrels of tough
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.14,0:00:12.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,foam on
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.57,0:00:13.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,steel posts.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.72,0:00:14.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,When a car
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.29,0:00:15.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,slides into them
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.10,0:00:15.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,they spin instead
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.99,0:00:16.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,of scraping.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.85,0:00:17.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,The foam squashes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.90,0:00:18.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,to soak up
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.45,0:00:18.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,the hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.09,0:00:19.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,And the spinning
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.78,0:00:20.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,turns part of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.53,0:00:21.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,the crash
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.06,0:00:21.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,into rotation.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.13,0:00:22.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,So the car
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.78,0:00:23.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,keeps rolling forward
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.97,0:00:24.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,and is steered
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.71,0:00:25.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,back toward
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.20,0:00:25.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,its lane.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.97,0:00:27.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,One version passed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.03,0:00:28.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,a sixty-two mile
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.10,0:00:28.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,an hour crash
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.86,0:00:29.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,test for
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.35,0:00:30.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,American roads.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.52,0:00:31.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,Korea already has
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.56,0:00:32.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,more than sixty
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.39,0:00:33.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,miles of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.32,0:00:33.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,That's why some
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.94,0:00:34.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,sharp curves are
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.77,0:00:35.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,lined with spinning
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.72,0:00:36.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,yellow rollers.
